ew editions are sure to delight readers of all ages. Pulled down from the clouds at the end of a kite string, Mary Poppins is back. In Mary's care, the Banks children meet the King of the Castle and the Dirty Rascal, visit the upside-down world of Mr. Turvy and his bride, Miss Topsy, and spend a breathless afternoon above the park, dangling from a clutch of balloons. Surprises are sure to pop up when Mary Poppins is around!","audioPreviewUrl":"https://audio-previews-media.api.yotoplay.com/audio-previews/6cf89344938084f1b92219093d02902dd188ec2aaf672f74a5a482d7c8844d80/xT9kqDSM2r1izUq01b0wbbys7OafDE-nlCHdgOApAts.mp3","seriesorder":2,"seriestitle":"The Mary Poppins Collection","cover":{"imageL":"https://card-content.yotoplay.com/yoto/pub/VdBnjTh7l9XHsvA1G7PkpR19pZzf-MJbqBRYS2cGBQs"},"languages":["en"],"media":{"duration":20896,"fileSize":223933841,"hasStreams":false},"status":{"name":"live","updatedAt":"2022-07-05T16:02:09.168Z"}},"cardId":"cy4Lw","createdAt":"2022-04-22T15:05:53.365Z","updatedAt":"2026-03-09T10:55:18.414Z","clubAvailability":[]},"ownership":{"canAccess":true,"userHasRole":false,"cardIsFree":false,"cardIsMadeByUser":false,"cardIsInFamilyLibrary":false,"cardIsCreatedByFamily":false,"isAccessibleUsingSubscription":false,"isAccessibleAsPhysicalPlay":false,"isShareLink":false,"isReconditionCard":false,"inCardPacks":false,"previewAccessOnly":true}}